          bio: "Based in Cotonou, I design showcase websites, mockups and interfaces with a particular focus on visual consistency and user experience, as a full stack web developer constantly growing. Beyond the code, I am above all a curious adventurer of general culture and knowledge, driven by a thirst to learn about education, knowledge and human development. Through projects like Cultivora Land and The DSK Journal, I seek to make ideas accessible and nurture my own thinking about the world. I believe every difficulty is an opportunity to grow - and that learning, exploring and endlessly cultivating myself are the values that give meaning to my journey.",
